It seems like it only happens, if the package building fails. Which
makes sense, but it also recompiles it, if the shared library is built
without errors, but something fails with the R code/docs. So I think
it still makes sense to fix this. Anyway, next time it start annoying
me, I'll take a closer look.

Best,
Gabor

